    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's Fight phase right after you select one of your TZEENTCH MUTANT units to fight; that unit is the target. Until the phase ends, Pile-in and Consolidation moves by its models may cover up to 6 inches instead of 3. When working out which of its models can fight, any model within 3 inches of an enemy model is eligible, and those models may direct their attacks at an enemy unit of that kind that lies within 3 inches of them and in Engagement Range of their own unit.",
